    "body": "<header>\n<h1 data-aid=\"128477299\" id=\"title1\"><strong>Jesus Christ, Creator</strong></h1>\n</header>\n<div class=\"body-block\">\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul class=\"reference\">\n<li>\n<p class=\"title\" data-aid=\"128477300\" id=\"title2\"><em>See also</em> <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/tg/god-creator?lang=eng\">God, Creator</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/tg/god-the-father-jehovah?lang=eng\">God the Father, Jehovah</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477301\" id=\"p1\">Let us <span class=\"key-word\">make</span> man in our image, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/gen/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p26#p26\">Gen. 1:26</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/pgp/moses/2?lang=eng&amp;id=p26-p27#p26\">Moses 2:26–27</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477302\" id=\"p2\">Lord … hast <span class=\"key-word\">made</span> heaven and earth, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/2-kgs/19?lang=eng&amp;id=p15#p15\">2 Kgs. 19:15</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/acts/14?lang=eng&amp;id=p15#p15\">Acts 14:15</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/mosiah/4?lang=eng&amp;id=p2#p2\">Mosiah 4:2</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/3-ne/9?lang=eng&amp;id=p15#p15\">3 Ne. 9:15</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/14?lang=eng&amp;id=p9#p9\">D&amp;C 14:9</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477303\" id=\"p3\">Thine hands have <span class=\"key-word\">made</span> me, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/job/10?lang=eng&amp;id=p8#p8\">Job 10:8</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477304\" id=\"p4\">when I <span class=\"key-word\">laid</span> the foundations of the earth, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/job/38?lang=eng&amp;id=p4#p4\">Job 38:4</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477305\" id=\"p5\">By the word of the Lord were the heavens <span class=\"key-word\">made</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/ps/33?lang=eng&amp;id=p6#p6\">Ps. 33:6</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477306\" id=\"p6\">Lord, the <span class=\"key-word\">Creator</span> of the ends of the earth, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/isa/40?lang=eng&amp;id=p28#p28\">Isa. 40:28</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477307\" id=\"p7\">Holy One of Israel hath <span class=\"key-word\">created</span> it, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/isa/41?lang=eng&amp;id=p20#p20\">Isa. 41:20</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477308\" id=\"p8\">Lord, he that <span class=\"key-word\">created</span> the heavens, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/isa/42?lang=eng&amp;id=p5#p5\">Isa. 42:5</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/isa/45?lang=eng&amp;id=p18#p18\">45:18</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477309\" id=\"p9\">redeemer … that <span class=\"key-word\">maketh</span> all things, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/isa/44?lang=eng&amp;id=p24#p24\">Isa. 44:24</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477310\" id=\"p10\">I have <span class=\"key-word\">made</span> the earth, and <span class=\"key-word\">created</span> man upon it, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/isa/45?lang=eng&amp;id=p12#p12\">Isa. 45:12</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/1-ne/17?lang=eng&amp;id=p36#p36\">1 Ne. 17:36</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477311\" id=\"p11\">I <span class=\"key-word\">create</span> new heavens and a new earth, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/isa/65?lang=eng&amp;id=p17#p17\">Isa. 65:17</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477312\" id=\"p12\">He hath <span class=\"key-word\">made</span> the earth by his power, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/jer/51?lang=eng&amp;id=p15#p15\">Jer. 51:15</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477313\" id=\"p13\">he that <span class=\"key-word\">formeth</span> the mountains, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/amos/4?lang=eng&amp;id=p13#p13\">Amos 4:13</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477314\" id=\"p14\">All things were <span class=\"key-word\">made</span> by him, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p3#p3\">John 1:3</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/col/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p16#p16\">Col. 1:16</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/rev/4?lang=eng&amp;id=p11#p11\">Rev. 4:11</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477315\" id=\"p15\">world was <span class=\"key-word\">made</span> by him, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p10#p10\">John 1:10</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/93?lang=eng&amp;id=p9#p9\">D&amp;C 93:9</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477316\" id=\"p16\">Hath not my hand <span class=\"key-word\">made</span> all these things, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/acts/7?lang=eng&amp;id=p50#p50\">Acts 7:50</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/mosiah/4?lang=eng&amp;id=p9#p9\">Mosiah 4:9</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477317\" id=\"p17\">who <span class=\"key-word\">created</span> all things by Jesus, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/eph/3?lang=eng&amp;id=p9#p9\">Eph. 3:9</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/hel/14?lang=eng&amp;id=p12#p12\">Hel. 14:12</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477318\" id=\"p18\">after the image of him that <span class=\"key-word\">created</span> him, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/col/3?lang=eng&amp;id=p10#p10\">Col. 3:10</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477319\" id=\"p19\">his Son … by whom also he <span class=\"key-word\">made</span> the worlds, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/heb/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p2#p2\">Heb. 1:2</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477320\" id=\"p20\">Lord … hast <span class=\"key-word\">laid</span> the foundation of the earth, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/heb/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p10#p10\">Heb. 1:10</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477321\" id=\"p21\">worlds were <span class=\"key-word\">framed</span> by the word of God, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/heb/11?lang=eng&amp;id=p3#p3\">Heb. 11:3</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477322\" id=\"p22\">he had <span class=\"key-word\">created</span> our first parents, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/2-ne/2?lang=eng&amp;id=p15#p15\">2 Ne. 2:15</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477323\" id=\"p23\">great <span class=\"key-word\">Creator</span> that he suffereth himself, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/2-ne/9?lang=eng&amp;id=p5#p5\">2 Ne. 9:5</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477324\" id=\"p24\">Lord … <span class=\"key-word\">created</span> all men, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/2-ne/29?lang=eng&amp;id=p7#p7\">2 Ne. 29:7</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/jacob/2?lang=eng&amp;id=p21#p21\">Jacob 2:21</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/alma/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p4#p4\">Alma 1:4</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477325\" id=\"p25\">earth was <span class=\"key-word\">created</span> by the power of his word, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/jacob/4?lang=eng&amp;id=p9#p9\">Jacob 4:9</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477326\" id=\"p26\">Jesus … the <span class=\"key-word\">Creator</span> of all things, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/mosiah/3?lang=eng&amp;id=p8#p8\">Mosiah 3:8</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/mosiah/5?lang=eng&amp;id=p15#p15\">5:15</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/mosiah/26?lang=eng&amp;id=p23#p23\">26:23</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477327\" id=\"p27\">glory of him that <span class=\"key-word\">created</span> you, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/mosiah/4?lang=eng&amp;id=p12#p12\">Mosiah 4:12</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477328\" id=\"p28\">redemption of him who <span class=\"key-word\">created</span> you, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/alma/5?lang=eng&amp;id=p15#p15\">Alma 5:15</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477329\" id=\"p29\">man have I <span class=\"key-word\">created</span> after the body of my spirit, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/ether/3?lang=eng&amp;id=p16#p16\">Ether 3:16</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477330\" id=\"p30\">by the power of my Spirit <span class=\"key-word\">created</span> I them, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/29?lang=eng&amp;id=p31#p31\">D&amp;C 29:31</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477331\" id=\"p31\">I am the same which spake, and the world was <span class=\"key-word\">made</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/38?lang=eng&amp;id=p3#p3\">D&amp;C 38:3</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477332\" id=\"p32\">who <span class=\"key-word\">made</span> the heavens and all the hosts, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/45?lang=eng&amp;id=p1#p1\">D&amp;C 45:1</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477333\" id=\"p33\">by him … the worlds are and were <span class=\"key-word\">created</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/76?lang=eng&amp;id=p24#p24\">D&amp;C 76:24</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477334\" id=\"p34\">he is in the sun … and the power thereof by which it was <span class=\"key-word\">made</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/88?lang=eng&amp;id=p7#p7\">D&amp;C 88:7</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477335\" id=\"p35\">Have I not <span class=\"key-word\">made</span> the earth, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/117?lang=eng&amp;id=p6#p6\">D&amp;C 117:6</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477336\" id=\"p36\">by the Son I <span class=\"key-word\">created</span> them, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/pgp/moses/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p33#p33\">Moses 1:33</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477337\" id=\"p37\">by mine Only Begotten I <span class=\"key-word\">created</span> these things, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/pgp/moses/2?lang=eng&amp;id=p1#p1\">Moses 2:1</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477338\" id=\"p38\"><span class=\"key-word\">we</span> will make an earth whereon these may dwell, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/pgp/abr/3?lang=eng&amp;id=p24#p24\">Abr. 3:24</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477339\" id=\"p39\"><span class=\"key-word\">Gods</span>, organized and formed the heavens and the earth, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/pgp/abr/4?lang=eng&amp;id=p1#p1\">Abr. 4:1</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul class=\"reference\">\n<li>\n<p class=\"title\" data-aid=\"128477340\" id=\"title3\"><em>See also</em> <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/job/26?lang=eng&amp;id=p13#p13\">Job 26:13</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/2-pet/3?lang=eng&amp;id=p5#p5\">2 Pet. 3:5</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/88?lang=eng&amp;id=p13#p13\">D&amp;C 88:13</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/104?lang=eng&amp;id=p17#p17\">104:17</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n</div>",
